petrus-engine-absurd
Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package is an independent Haskell implementation that reproduces the
observable behaviour of the pinned Petrus Python reference (see UPSTREAM.md
at the repository root). Its refusal texts are reproduced from that
reference, and it composes the PostgreSQL History store and the Absurd
Dispatch so that both implementations share one database, one History
schema, and one Absurd schema. The driver scripts in test/interop and bench
run the reference itself from the pinned upstream virtual environment.

